    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSet in the peaceful countryside of Bunnacranna, Curry, Co. Sligo, this charming two-storey detached residence offers a wonderful opportunity to acquire a traditional family home together with approximately 11.60 acres of good-quality agricultural land...\n\nCombining comfortable accommodation, generous grounds and useful agricultural facilities, the property is ideally suited to those seeking a rural lifestyle, hobby farming or equestrian use, while remaining within easy reach of local amenities.\n\nThe ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance porch, living room, sitting room, kitchen/dining room, utility room, guest WC and a double bedroom with ensuite.\n\nUpstairs, there are three further bedrooms, including a spacious master bedroom with ensuite and walk-in wardrobe, together with a family bathroom.\n\nThe property benefits from oil-fired central heating and offers excellent scope for a family looking to enjoy the space and tranquillity of country living.\n\nThe lands extend to approximately 11.60 acres of good-quality agricultural land, providing excellent potential for farming, hobby farming, grazing or equestrian use.\n\nA traditional stone granary is also included and is located across the road from the house, providing additional character and useful storage/farm potential.\n\nThe property is situated in the peaceful townland of Bunnacranna, Curry, approximately 5 km from Charlestown and only 12 km from Knock airport. The location provides a wonderful balance between private countryside living and convenient access to local schools, shops, sporting facilities and other amenities with the local pub and hotel within walking distance.\n\nThe property is also well positioned for access to the wider Mayo and Sligo areas.\n\nProperties offering a traditional family home together with a substantial acreage of agricultural land and existing farm buildings are increasingly difficult to find. This property presents an excellent opportunity for those seeking a country home with space, land and potential.\n\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the setting, accommodation, land and character this property has to offer. There is an option to purchase the house on 1 acre."
      },
